{"4182560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marble Odyssey: Sandbox", "steam_appid": 4182560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marble Odyssey: Sandbox</strong> is a peaceful and mesmerizing marble simulator set on a floating wooden table drifting through a cosmic nebula. Build your own marble playground using dozens of handcrafted blocks — from simple paths and ramps to holes, slides, and solid cubes — all arranged on a clean, grid-based surface that makes building effortless and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're creating gentle loops, experimental contraptions, elegant cascades, or massive marble factories, the game invites you to play with physics in a calm and cozy space. Every block snaps neatly into place, every color theme transforms the table into a new mood, and every marble behaves with authentic physical detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE EVERY BLOCK WITH EASE</strong><br>Change marbles, rotate pieces, and watch your playground come alive! Snap blocks into place, experiment with marble types, and create your own mesmerizing marble setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.poster.avif?t=1764949790\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.webm?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.mp4?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEE ALL THE BLOCKS IN ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paths, ramps, holes, slides, and mechanical blocks — discover the endless possibilities and create your own marble playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.poster.avif?t=1764949790\" width=620 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.webm?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.mp4?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix ramps, slides, and mechanical blocks, tweak rotations and setups, and see how your creations come alive. The fun is in every experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/0a4eab098534e447128b7a65b4679061.poster.avif?t=1764949790\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/0a4eab098534e447128b7a65b4679061.webm?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/0a4eab098534e447128b7a65b4679061.mp4?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ building blocks</strong> including paths, ramps, holes, slides, and solid cubes — each available in <strong>6 color themes</strong>, just like the tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 mechanical blocks</strong> to create automated marble systems: timed generator, elevator, pusher, speed booster, and splitter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 unique marble variants</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 table color themes</strong> to set the mood for your marble playground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid-based building</strong> for clean, precise, and easy construction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic physics simulation</strong> with detailed marble sound design — hear every roll, click, and collision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-look camera</strong> giving full creative freedom to explore your tracks from every angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing, cozy sandbox experience</strong> with no goals or pressure — just pure creative play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tiny universe of marbles — shaped entirely by you.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marble Odyssey: Sandbox</strong> is a peaceful and mesmerizing marble simulator set on a floating wooden table drifting through a cosmic nebula. Build your own marble playground using dozens of handcrafted blocks — from simple paths and ramps to holes, slides, and solid cubes — all arranged on a clean, grid-based surface that makes building effortless and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're creating gentle loops, experimental contraptions, elegant cascades, or massive marble factories, the game invites you to play with physics in a calm and cozy space. Every block snaps neatly into place, every color theme transforms the table into a new mood, and every marble behaves with authentic physical detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE EVERY BLOCK WITH EASE</strong><br>Change marbles, rotate pieces, and watch your playground come alive! Snap blocks into place, experiment with marble types, and create your own mesmerizing marble setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.poster.avif?t=1764949790\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.webm?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/49cdfeecab9fff08ba1191ea4de4ccce.mp4?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEE ALL THE BLOCKS IN ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paths, ramps, holes, slides, and mechanical blocks — discover the endless possibilities and create your own marble playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.poster.avif?t=1764949790\" width=620 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.webm?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182560/extras/df3d4ecc12202a1964d68a76c9cfd23b.mp4?t=1764949790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix ramps, slides, and mechanical blocks, tweak rotations and setups, and see how your creations come alive. The fun is in every experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a